<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-April budget deficit SKK 4.69bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-April budget deficit SKK 4.69bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's state budget posted a deficit of 4.692 billion crowns for the first four months of this year, up from 3.45 billion for the first quarter, the Finance Ministry said on Monday.  </p>
<p> STATE BUDGET	    JAN-APR 97 JAN-MAR 97 JAN-APR 96 97 PLAN</p>
<p>  Expenditures (SKK BLN) 60.773	43.374    59.868     208.0</p>
<p>  Revenues		   56.081	39.923    55.481     171.1</p>
<p>  Balance		    -4.692	-3.450    -4.387     -36.9</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
